  "question": {
    "text": "Sum of bond order of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CO</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>NO</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Bond order is the number of chemical bonds between a pair of atoms and indicates the stability of a bond. </p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Bond</mi><mo> </mo><mi>order</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Number</mi><mo> </mo><mi>of</mi><mo> </mo><mi>bonding</mi><mo> </mo><mi>electrons</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>number</mi><mo> </mo><mi>of</mi><mo> </mo><mi>antibonding</mi><mo> </mo><mi>electrons</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>The given two molecules have the same number of electrons(14) like nitrogen molecule.</p><p>Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CO</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mo>  </mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>≡</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo></mover><mo>  </mo><mo>:</mo><mi>BO</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>NO</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>≡</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>  </mo><mo>:</mo><mi>BO</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>The sum of the bond order of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CO</mi><mo> </mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>NO</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
